{"id":"97877ee11b1b05a4","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-splitting-real.md","title":"ZFC Splitting Real","display":"df-zfc-splitting-real — ZFC Splitting Real","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-splitting-real","aliases":["58-df-zfc-splitting-real"],"display":"df-zfc-splitting-real — ZFC Splitting Real","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-splitting]]","[[58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference]]","[[58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]","[[58-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-splitting-real"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-splitting-real</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-splitting-real — ZFC Splitting Real"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0129e327740919d4\" href=\"?note=0129e327740919d4\" title=\"58-df-splitting\">58-df-splitting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90335d0f6a9bc60f\" href=\"?note=90335d0f6a9bc60f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference\">58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set\">58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(x\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> (splitting real candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\)</span> (family of infinite sets to be split)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplittingReal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SplittingReal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\mathrm{SplittingReal}_S(x,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow x\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega):\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\\}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap x)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\setminus x)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\mathrm{SplittingReal}_S(x,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow x\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega):\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\\}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap x)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\setminus x)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Infinitude is expressed by the registered finite-set predicate rather than cardinality notation; the real is relative to an explicitly typed family.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"0129e327740919d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-splitting]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference","status":"resolved","id":"90335d0f6a9bc60f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplittingReal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}real} \\vdash \\mathrm{SplittingReal}_S(x,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow x\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\{A\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega):\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\\}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap x)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\setminus x)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1128,"backlinks":[{"id":"16a6071f8070de5d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3493","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-splitting-real.md|58-df-zfc-splitting-real]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","0129e327740919d4","90335d0f6a9bc60f","f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}